Copyright 2026 Prosecco 37 d.o.o., and are contributed under the MIT licence
with the permission of Prosecco 37 d.o.o. The ported portions are:

- the substitution engine (placeholder allocation, PERSON name sub-placeholders,
  masking and reveal), from lib/anonymizer.js and lib/id-set.js, in
  nodes/Anonymizator/shared/anonymizer.ts;
- the HPKE (RFC 9180) request sealing and wire format, from lib/hpke.js, in
  nodes/Anonymizator/shared/hpke.ts;
- the gateway client logic (keyconfig verification, sealed analyze requests,
  status handling), from lib/gateway.js, in nodes/Anonymizator/shared/gateway.ts
  and nodes/Anonymizator/shared/keyconfig.ts;
- the entity catalog, from lib/entities.js, in nodes/Anonymizator/shared/entities.ts;
- the ID file format and its parse rules, from sidepanel/sidepanel-idfile.js, in
  nodes/Anonymizator/shared/placeholderMap.ts.
